' Independently authored Kobrixa curriculum.
number answer
Combine(12, 7, answer)
PrintValue(answer)
Program.Delay(1000)
Function Combine(in number a, in number b, out number result)
  result = a * 2 + b
EndFunction
Function PrintValue(in number value)
  LCD.Text(1, 4, 16, 1, "Result: " + value)
EndFunction
